45
00:02:33,260 --> 00:02:39,320
So to marinate something or which is a verb or the steaks and chickens are marinated which is an adjective.

46
00:02:39,940 --> 00:02:50,280
So basically means that you have added spices and maybe some lemon juice, different herbs or salts to the meats in order to give it flavor before you cook them.

47
00:02:50,510 --> 00:02:50,910
Exactly.

48
